$landings.n
[1] "thousands"

$landings.wt
[1] "kg"

$stock
[1] "tonnes"

$stock.n
[1] "NA"

$stock.wt
[1] "kg"

$m
[1] "NA"

$mat
[1] "NA"

$harvest
[1] "f"

$harvest.spwn
[1] "NA"


I'm using:

R version 3.0.2 (2013-09-25)
Platform: x86_64-pc-linux-gnu (64-bit) UBUNTU

and FLCore version  FLCore_2.5.20140213


Thanks in advance

